ok - opener text above the block refuses the whole body whatever seems to close it: an HTML block, a list fence, a code span, an inline tag, a longer fence or an open comment
ok - a block above every example closes; the example lines below it close nothing and are reported
ok - a malformed directive-shaped line outside the block reports each id and each link on it, in the merged body and a member body; nothing closes
